CRANE (Chemistry and Radiation in Atmospheres with Nonlinear Evolution)

-photochem works with conda environment
-pyharp is independent of environment, just need to  pip install pyharp

verions:

pyharp: 1.6.8
https://github.com/chengcli/pyharp/

photochem: 0.6.2
https://github.com/Nicholaswogan/photochem



issues:

right now, need to kill amars.py (main) with kill -9 PID
when running multiple processes of the model on one computer (multiple threads), photochem sometimes tries to access and hd5 file at the same time, which causes a crash. to prevent this, type this "export HDF5_USE_FILE_LOCKING=FALSE" before you execute your main
